          "short": "$\\frac{4}{7}$",
          "worked": "Septuplets are a set of 7 children. Four of the 7 children are girls, so the fraction is $\\frac{4}{7}$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 12
      },
      {
